age."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 2.5%, and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Insider trading is two-way: 6 purchases and 8 sales over the past year, net $129.7M sold.","The share count has grown 10.9% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","Short interest is elevated at 15.5% of the float, 5.5 days to cover."],"people":["CEO pay is $1.6M, and compensation governance scores well (2/10, lower is better)."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":55,"head":"Watch: composite 43, above the 39 line, but no margin of safety; it becomes a buy below $14.20.","pros":["Composite 43, above the 39 line (gates 9/25)","Revenue grew 22.7%/yr over 5y","Net cash of $40.3M","6 analysts' mean target $32.33 (+88%)"],"cons":["Trades 3% above fair value of $16.71","P/E 28.1x vs sector 17.5x","EV/EBITDA 12.8x vs sector 10.0x","Heavy insider selling ($129.7M net over 12 months)"],"flags":[],"need":["no margin of safety"],"buy_below":14.2,"vc":{"base":16.71,"base_src":"dcf","bear":13.55,"bull":21.16,"alt_median":11.69,"n_alt":2,"gap":0.4293,"dispersion":0.1881,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":17.5447,"ev_ebitda":10.0,"pfcf":15.3688,"pb":1.9293,"roic":0.1206,"gross_margin":0.3381,"fcf_margin":0.0601,"div_yield":0.0311}},"mc_quantiles":[11.38,12.66,13.55,14.01,14.48,14.9,15.27,15.71,16.06,16.4,16.8,17.19,17.56,17.99,18.41,18.97,19.62,20.2,21.16,22.83,25.91],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.489,"discount_rate":0.42,"terminal_growth":0.018,"exit_multiple":0.073},"ticker":"UTI","date":"2026-11-20"}